    "text": "By Rachel King ,\n12 hours ago It’s no secret how much the British royal family loves sports. The royals have been strong supporters of England’s women’s national football team, which has risen to become one of the top squads in the world in recent years. The Lionesses, as they are fondly known by their fans, won the 2025 UEFA European Women’s Championship, becoming back-to-back European Champions in July. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
